<title>UK: Argenta sets 2.0 billion Lux franc six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Argenta sets 2.0 billion Lux franc six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque et Caisse d&quot;Epargne de l&quot;Etat.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTA NEDERLAND NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ARGENTA SPAARBANK (ANTWERP)</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.10	MATURITY    11.MAR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 PRAECIPUUM 0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
